LINES = [{'id': 'rule', 'text': 'In this town, every time you make someone laugh, you grow a little taller. Gus the mailman trips a lot.'}, {'id': 'gus', 'text': 'That was laugh number four hundred and thirteen. Gus delivers mail straight into second floor windows.'}, {'id': 'dad', 'text': "Then there's my dad. He tells the worst jokes in town. Zero laughs, ever. He's the size of a fire hydrant."}, {'id': 'cookie', 'text': 'His best one: why did the cookie go to the doctor? It felt crummy. Even the pigeons left.'}, {'id': 'catch', 'text': "And there's one catch. If you laugh at your OWN joke, you shrink. That's why Grandpa is shorter than his mailbox."}, {'id': 'bruno', 'text': 'Then Bruno found a shortcut. Why tell jokes? Just push people over, and everybody laughs.'}, {'id': 'pushes', 'text': 'Push, splat, ha ha. Push, splat, ha ha. By lunch, Bruno was taller than the trees.'}, {'id': 'chaos', 'text': 'By dinner, the whole town was falling over. Gus, Dad, everybody. Splat, splat, splat.'}, {'id': 'king', 'text': 'Bruno got so tall he crowned himself King of Funny, and made a brand new law.'}, {'id': 'quiet', 'text': 'No jokes for anyone but Bruno. Gus stopped tripping. Dad stopped joking. The whole town went quiet.'}, {'id': 'brave', 'text': 'So I did something small and brave. I dressed up exactly like Bruno and marched right up to him.'}, {'id': 'act', 'text': 'Then I did his whole act, in his own snooty voice. Bow down! I am the King of Funny!'}, {'id': 'snort', 'text': 'Bruno snorted. He was laughing at his own act. And you remember the catch, right?'}, {'id': 'hydrant', 'text': "He couldn't stop. Snort, shrink, snort, shrink. The King of Funny ended up hydrant sized, just like Dad."}, {'id': 'crown', 'text': 'Then Dad stepped up. Hey Bruno, why did the king go to the dentist? To get a crown!'}, {'id': 'first', 'text': "And Bruno laughed. A real laugh. Dad's first one ever. He shot up so fast he bonked the streetlight."}, {'id': 'end', 'text': "Now the law says laugh with people, not at them. Dad's still not funny. I laugh anyway. Tallest dad in town."}]
